                                "sense_id": "e69b2f33-35b0-3613-86ad-f4e2b63112e4",
                                "text": "Man projects the future as futurable (possible)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0a81739-d436-411b-9890-3084cac365e4",
                                "sense_id": "e69b2f33-35b0-3613-86ad-f4e2b63112e4",
                                "text": "By contrast to his crystal-clear, futurable insights, however, the 'furious reporter' leaves us very much in the dark with regard to what's going on right now."
